cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Antimatter Factory: an interactive 3D tour of CERN's AD / ELENA antimatter chain"
abstract: >-
  An interactive browser model of how antimatter is made at CERN, from the
  hydrogen source through Linac4, the PS Booster and the Proton Synchrotron to
  the iridium target, the Antiproton Decelerator, ELENA, the experiments and a
  close-up trap lab. 21 clickable stations with short explanations, key
  figures and a guided tour. The model is schematic; scale and layout are
  simplified. Turkish and English interfaces.
authors:
